WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.372
In tutorial 5.4, you'll decide on each
page before your weekly run writes it.

00:00:12.685 --> 00:00:17.005
First, on your Overview, click Coming
up. Two days before each weekly run,

00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:19.002
it shows what that run will write.

00:00:21.114 --> 00:00:25.264
Pages written on their own come
first, each with the credits it uses.

00:00:25.314 --> 00:00:27.140
The others wait for your OK.

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:32.213
Next, Approve adds a
waiting page to that run.

00:00:32.263 --> 00:00:34.286
And every page has a Skip button.

00:00:36.618 --> 00:00:40.976
Open Skip, then choose This week
only, or Never suggest it again.

00:00:43.639 --> 00:00:47.789
Want a page sooner? Go to Needs you
on your Pipeline, and click Write it.

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:51.515
The window shows why, the page
type, and its keyword ladder.

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:57.328
Its button shows the credits, and the page
is written right away, as its own report.

00:00:59.504 --> 00:01:03.929
Now you see every page before your
weekly run writes it, with its credits,

00:01:03.979 --> 00:01:06.632
and each one is yours to approve or skip.

00:01:07.663 --> 00:01:10.858
So: open Coming up,
approve or skip a page,

00:01:10.908 --> 00:01:13.169
and write a page now
when you want it sooner.

00:01:14.638 --> 00:01:17.238
Every page gets your say. Next,

00:01:17.288 --> 00:01:22.474
set each ladder to Auto or Manual and
put them in order, in tutorial 5.5.
